{"unit_id":"Arbeiter-bit__dsh-reedit#card-zh","repo":"Arbeiter-bit/dsh-reedit","commit":"dddb9749cdf14358e535ab772e938102d104e9a6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-reedit 是一款面向 DSH 网页客户端的会话编辑插件。它在聊天界面接管用户消息气泡，让用户可以双击自己的消息打开编辑框，再从原消息之前创建一个新会话分支，将修改后的文本发送到分支并在主面板打开。编辑不会改写原会话，原消息之后的内容也不会带入新分支。界面还提供复制消息、编辑失败后重试、附件和引用标签显示，以及编辑分支提示。适合需要修正先前提问并从修改处继续对话的网页用户。安装命令见 README；代码中未定义额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:214","client.js:261","client.js:330-352","README.md:44-58"]}
{"unit_id":"Arbeiter-bit__dsh-reedit#card-en","repo":"Arbeiter-bit/dsh-reedit","commit":"dddb9749cdf14358e535ab772e938102d104e9a6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-reedit lets DSH web users edit their own message and resend it from a new branch created before that message, keeping the original conversation intact. It also supports copying messages and showing resend status. Useful for correcting a prompt and continuing from there.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:214","client.js:261","client.js:330-352","README.md:44-58"]}
